   "created_at": "2024-05-18T15:40:35+00:00",
   "body_html": "<!--[if BLOCK]><![endif]-->            <p>This may seem strange coming from me, but do not rely on thermal scopes too much.</p>\n<p>It takes away a good portion of the experience that is at the core of the gameplay.</p>\n<p>The goal of this mod is not to make you use thermal scopes on every raid, but rather when you do find them, be rewarded with an amazing force multiplier that gives you the proper advantage, but also the thrill and fear of losing it.</p>\n\n        <!--[if ENDBLOCK]><![endif]-->",
